        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Ives 580, Double Ceiling Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Double Pronged Hook is ideal for light duty projects around the house. It is easy to install--it just screws in with the packed hardware. This hook can be used either on the wall to hold items like purses or from the ceiling. It is available in a wide array of finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-345-finishes.jpg?v=1704354748\" width=\"492\" height=\"288\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Ives 580 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Ives 580 Double Wall Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Height: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Prong Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: (2) 3/4x7 O.H. wood screw or #6 O.H. Machine Screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li>Material: cast aluminum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
